  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialText_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3488ca378e6e01d488f136c270b8cfd2, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 5925276117622850237
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1924562071552
    m_Localized: VR Controls Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2297217593344
    m_Localized: Previous
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2342872592384
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2373344210944
    m_Localized: Finish
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25955529043968
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26251961479168
    m_Localized: You can move around smoothly with the left thumbstick, or teleport
      by holding the right thumbstick forward and releasing it once the arrow is
      where you want it. We recommend you use Teleportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27811156242432
    m_Localized: Doors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27841548169216
    m_Localized: Some doors may be interactable in different ways, using the "Grab"
      trigger. Try it out with the doors on the right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27924679274496
    m_Localized: Doors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5925276117622850237
  - m_Id: 27985102417920
    m_Localized: Some doors may be interactable in different ways, using the "Grab"
      trigger. Try it out with the doors on the right
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5925276117622850237
  - m_Id: 28171165937664
    m_Localized: Finished!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28212194619392
    m_Localized: That's all you need to know from this tutorial. Hit "Finish" and
      you'll have access to whatever comes next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28267643318272
    m_Localized: Looking Around
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28284957405184
    m_Localized: VR allows you to look around the room in every direction. Follow
      the arrows and look at every target to get used to this
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28364095533056
    m_Localized: Grab Objects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28365907472384
    m_Localized: You can use the grips on either hand to grab objects. Try picking
      the objects in front of you up and placing them on the red platforms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28366456926208
    m_Localized: Grab from a Distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28367039934464
    m_Localized: You can also grab objects that are far away from a distance by aiming
      the line in front of the controllers at them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28367736188928
    m_Localized: Moving with Objects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28371590754304
    m_Localized: After you grab an object, it's still possible to move or teleport
      with it. Try going and retrieving the object on the other side of the wall
      while holding it the entire time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28584049029120
    m_Localized: Moving with Objects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5925276117622850237
  - m_Id: 28605737775104
    m_Localized: After you grab an object, it's still possible to move or teleport
      with it. Try going and retrieving the object on the other side of the wall
      while holding it the entire time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5925276117622850237
  - m_Id: 28619214073856
    m_Localized: Hidden Objects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28667926720512
    m_Localized: Important objects may be hidden behind interactions in the environment.
      If something changes color, you can probably grab it to do something. Try exploring
      behind you to find the hidden blocks to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28683739246592
    m_Localized: Introduction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28765091966976
    m_Localized: This tutorial aims to familiarise you with some common VR controls
      that you might need in the following VR experiences. To start, you can use
      the triggers on either hand to interact with User Interface buttons. Click
      "Next" to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28779189022720
    m_Localized: Outlined Objects
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28806963703808
    m_Localized: Objects of particular importance may be highlighted with an outline
      and have a silhoutte that can be seen through objects. These are important
      for progression, so be sure to look out for them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28833882746880
    m_Localized: Re-centering your view
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28890224832512
    m_Localized: At any point, you can hold down the indented button on the right
      controller to reposition the scene to where you are looking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28906595201024
    m_Localized: Smooth Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28955286876160
    m_Localized: You can move around smoothly with the left thumbstick. Be careful
      as this can make you feel nauseous if you are not used to it. Try walking around
      and going through the red targets as they appear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28982105255936
    m_Localized: Smooth Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29027848335360
    m_Localized: You can move around smoothly with the thumbstick on either controller.
      Be careful as this can make you feel nauseous if you are not used to it. Try
      walking around and going through the red targets as they appear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29046873698304
    m_Localized: Sockets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29087898185728
    m_Localized: Some objects might snap into specific positions called sockets.
      They can be put in and sometimes taken back out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29111495340032
    m_Localized: Teleportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29166637854720
    m_Localized: Holding the right thumbstick forward allows you to instantly move,
      commonly referred to as teleporting, to where the visual is when you let go.
      Move around the table and teleport to the red areas when they appear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29192663511040
    m_Localized: Teleportation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29236246523904
    m_Localized: Holding the thumbstick forward on either controller allows you to
      instantly move, commonly referred to as teleporting, to where the visual is
      when you let go. Move around the table and teleport to the red areas when they
      appear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29251824168960
    m_Localized: Interact with User Interfaces (UI)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29274297249792
    m_Localized: Screen elements might be used for various purposes. Try some out
      on the other screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34149919797248
    m_Localized: Normal doors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34201371324416
    m_Localized: If you hover over a door and it "highlights", you can open it using
      the Grab trigger and walk through
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34581102637056
    m_Localized: Outlined Doors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34590900531200
    m_Localized: If a door is already highlighted with an outline, you can grab it
      and it will transition to the next scene. Try grabbing it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34813857148928
    m_Localized: Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34815140605952
    m_Localized: You can head back to the desk now to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35094430920704
    m_Localized: "Drop the \nobject here"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35430633746432
    m_Localized: Grab me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35771752296448
    m_Localized: Skip Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35773371297792
    m_Localized: If you don't need the tutorial, you can skip it directly by clicking
      the button below. This is not recommended unless you are familiar with VR interactions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 35825586188288
    m_Localized: Config Selector
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36151735267328
    m_Localized: Do not change the selected option unless instructed to
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36219968204800
    m_Localized: Choose one from below
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36731723624448
    m_Localized: Click around below
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36782541811712
    m_Localized: Buttons in the environment can be clicked and do various "one time"
      actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36857988952064
    m_Localized: Success
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36874665504768
    m_Localized: Error
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36892575182848
    m_Localized: Grayed out buttons are disabled, and cannot be interacted with
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36911130783744
    m_Localized: Inactive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36928197406720
    m_Localized: Toggles are used to turn on or off continuous actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 37844069822464
    m_Localized: Blink
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38130469482496
    m_Localized: UI Press
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38214301036544
    m_Localized: Grab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38420614656000
    m_Localized: Options
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38465833447424
    m_Localized: Re-center
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38663703932928
    m_Localized: Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 38737561432064
    m_Localized: Turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43384284033024
    m_Localized: The Tutorial is Done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43443419525120
    m_Localized: If you're seeing this, you should let the person helping you know
      you're done, and they'll tell you what to do next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 44061622185984
    m_Localized: Choose a language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47380235202560
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47646489620480
    m_Localized: Back to Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23999530250186752
    m_Localized: When holding an object, you can press the trigger to do some specific
      action that only happens while it's held
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23999806994558976
    m_Localized: Held Actions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
